{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ERN2oUDj\">调用 API 需要遵循 API 系统本身的限制，我们针对 API 所有的接口都进行了一定程度的调用频次限制，本篇将为您介绍我们的频控限制。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-K8v7RhYu\" id=\"h490b8bf-JD7Da5OO\">什么是频控</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-kSmzT3kv\">单位时间（目前均为秒级，即qps）内请求接口的次数限制。目前开放平台有两种频控限制，分别为：开发者频控、接口总频控</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"t685b3ee-j0aQN1ZE\" class=\"data-table\" style=\"width: 879px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"879px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Zpqoteyf\"><col width=\"134\" data-id=\"c9315f43-Jg2i7HOR\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"300\" data-id=\"ccb7e4df-PXD6Q50A\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"445\" data-id=\"c832ab4f-cLQ7ZTgM\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-iUq9C1vr\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ERhUcT40\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tab294e0-Of5DVMcj\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XGNQ3Pp9\"><strong>频控类型</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tab294e0-JOlpbAYN\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wpoB4OM8\"><strong>介绍</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t06d92d6-jSKISoVZ\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rjnH83NX\"><strong>超限限制</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-DoQRYsI3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-VLcUN9lm\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-h9qqjDzr\">开发者频控</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-C3TiUgpm\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YcXhZMw3\">开发者单位时间内请求单接口请求次数限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-eRbEM39b\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Kz5GFisu\">超限报错错误码为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">40110</code> ，可查看开发者自身频控限制范围，调整请求频次在自身频控范围内</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-heHuk2Eo\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-PZYSM64n\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BZDo1CzU\">接口总频控</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-MRaOaWCU\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ubYkw2ue\">单位时间内所有开发者请求单接口次数限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-TOEf3Xkf\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2NQuCLvh\">超限报错错误码为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">40100</code> ，接口总频控由系统动态调整，可在开发者频控范围内重试，或错峰，避免整点或半点峰期使用。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tYZpJ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-yj7PvEXu%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Eqps%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%87%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A7%92%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yj7PvEXu\"><strong>qps计算时间区间为当前请求至请求前一秒时间区间内的总请求次数，非自然秒</strong></p></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-7Fu1Wn6v\" id=\"h490b8bf-n4pDelQi\">如何查看频控</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-vwsIsvH5\" id=\"h6f20189-96JulXgp\">开发者频控</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-34TKZN5a\">开发者频控可在开发者后台-账号管理-接口频控处查看（如下图：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/qps\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">前往查看</a>），接口信息处标注了不同接口对应频控</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wkqwh%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-BOVK2R97%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E6%9C%AA%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%88%99%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E3%80%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E3%80%8D%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-gNw1UwBH%5C%22%3E%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3A%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3B%E6%9C%AA%E5%8D%95%E7%8B%AC%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%EF%BC%8C%E3%80%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E3%80%8D%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8qps%E4%B8%BA10%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3A%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94qps%E4%B8%BA10%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3B%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94qps%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%BA10%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%84%E8%87%AA%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BOVK2R97\"><strong>未单独标注接口则按照默认「其他」类别计算</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-gNw1UwBH\">如：接口A、接口B未单独标注，「其他」类别标注qps为10，则接口A对应qps为10，接口B对应qps也为10，各自独立</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-uA3s2ljT\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/1a0b953e712f48c1899835d4dbde1aa8~noop.image?x-expires=1999049412&amp;x-signature=AcPkHvyt7ZtWyr9ZVHYnsqYeEkA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-aLqxPjJg\" id=\"h6f20189-d0Z9CwlA\">如何提升开发者频控</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-Zjmp3RNV\">开发者后台-账号管理-接口频控处查看，如符合条件（由系统根据符合客户量级及相关消耗自动计算）则会展示申请提额入口，目前最高等级为三级</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-fMvzOam5\" id=\"h490b8bf-ZGOAcYmP\">接口总频控</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-8r7YhwLT\">接口总频控是<strong>由系统动态调整，非固定值</strong>。单位时间内所有开发者请求汇总的限制，并非单独针对某一个开发者请求，权重优先级高于开发者自身频控，一般峰期时间段可能会出现总频控限制报错。</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-kRr2nrBp\" id=\"h6f20189-GeZVbMiT\">如何提升接口总频控</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-G4qy9pUA\">接口总频控与开发者无关，由系统动态调整。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5czpPqty\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-cyopt9Ea\" id=\"h490b8bf-te9Gvpbp\">频控惩罚</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-6e7qwD4k\">每一个开发者应用都设置了三个不同等级的调用频次限制，包括了 QPS、调用分钟限制、调用天限制，具体的规则如下：</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UBJRt%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-5bCUQfib%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%A7%92%E7%BA%A7%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%99%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E9%A2%91%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E8%B6%85%E9%99%90%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E8%B6%85%E9%99%90%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E5%A4%96%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E7%BA%A7%E6%88%96%E5%A4%A9%E7%BA%A7%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E4%BC%9A%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E6%83%A9%E7%BD%9A%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5bCUQfib\"><strong>触发秒级频控则会报错</strong>，如不根据频控限制降低请求频次，持续超限请求，除超限部分请求报错外，触发分钟级或天级频控限制后，将会引发惩罚机制</p></div></div></div><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-id=\"t965bc8b-d8b7Mchk\" data-custom=\"true\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-x3EVKDND\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c864058c-jHbeiQh4\" width=\"155\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"cd4aae67-Z3kKhhl6\" width=\"724\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-j7cHAkp8\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9m2At0hG\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tab294e0-OBXnmEk2\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LtAwGXQi\"><strong>类别</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t06d92d6-EeUgneKU\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dR3XX9pD\"><strong>限制描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dtlA9qFG\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-D7nnXBNI\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hrqqRC2Y\">调用天频次</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-2CBPLe9N\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YjsafJiy\">达到限制后报错，同时当日将无法继续调用超限的接口，第二个自然日可自动恢复正常。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-hJbVoh9E\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-1a29dqSF\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cZSIqk6Z\">调用分钟频次</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-QCi52LLF\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aohsaNXe\">达到限制后报错，同时无法继续需要暂停当前接口的调用，5分钟后自动恢复正常</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-LlhlKrPC\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-EQR6kGRa\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Zwi2Suf3\">调用秒级限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t960a29a-LcZcfkBS\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5WHS8YfL\">达到限制后报错，但可以继续调用</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-R6UMycWQ\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-fycvsk9C\" id=\"h490b8bf-xM2xwsce\">频控建议方案</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-mTE4DAsa\" id=\"h6f20189-7cOdVxpx\">限流器</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-s2BO1Bjb\">您可以在客户端自己实现&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rate_limiting\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">限流器</a>&nbsp;，控制并发请求数量。例如，您可以实现&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Token_bucket\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">令牌桶算法</a>&nbsp;：按照频控规则下发令牌（如每秒下发 10 个令牌），在请求前尝试获取令牌，如果当前没有令牌则等待一段时间后重试。</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-P9yabapB\" id=\"h6f20189-WVrffRqz\">消息队列</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ieDLjDyG\">一种更加健壮的实现是使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Message_queue\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">消息队列</a>&nbsp;。定时脚本不直接负责请求 API，而是采用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Producer%E2%80%93consumer_problem\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">生产者-消费者</a>&nbsp;模型：将请求任务推送至消息队列，由专门的消费者从队列中取出任务进行消费（即请求 API）。您可以通过限制对某一类任务的并发消费者数量或使用限流器，从而达到限制请求并发数量的目的。对于执行失败的任务，可以将其重新推送至队列中（并设置一定延时）进行重试。</p></div>",
